                        className="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-[10px] font-bold text-rose-400 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 transition-all cursor-pointer shrink-0"                        title="Als Zielpunkt setzen"                      >                        Setze Aktuell                      </button>                    )}
                  </div>                  {
